{"book": "JHN", "chapter": 19, "lang": "en", "bible": "KJV-2026", "engine": "chatterbox-videos-v1", "durationMs": 334053, "verses": [{"verse": 1, "start": 300, "end": 3177, "text": "Then Pilate therefore took Jesus, and scourged him.", "words": [[0, 300], [5, 448], [12, 888], [22, 1208], [27, 1488], [34, 1908], [38, 2308], [47, 2848]]}, {"verse": 2, "start": 3528, "end": 8798, "text": "And the soldiers platted a crown of thorns, and put it on his head, and they put on him a purple robe,", "words": [[0, 3528], [4, 3653], [8, 3753], [17, 4183], [25, 4613], [27, 4693], [33, 4933], [36, 5093], [44, 5513], [48, 5713], [52, 5913], [55, 6033], [58, 6173], [62, 6313], [68, 6833], [72, 7133], [77, 7253], [81, 7433], [84, 7593], [88, 7773], [90, 7893], [97, 8133]]}, {"verse": 3, "start": 9148, "end": 13377, "text": "And said, Hail, King of the Jews! and they struck him with their hands.", "words": [[0, 9148], [4, 9408], [10, 10062], [16, 10244], [21, 10484], [24, 10644], [28, 10744], [34, 11501], [38, 11640], [43, 11760], [50, 12080], [54, 12340], [59, 12540], [65, 12700]]}, {"verse": 4, "start": 13727, "end": 21841, "text": "Pilate therefore went forth again, and says to them, Behold, I bring him forth to you, that you may know that I find no fault in him.", "words": [[0, 13727], [7, 14149], [17, 14509], [22, 14829], [28, 15149], [35, 15589], [39, 16149], [44, 16369], [47, 16609], [53, 17173], [61, 17728], [63, 17768], [69, 18068], [73, 18268], [79, 18628], [82, 18888], [87, 19388], [92, 19568], [96, 19708], [100, 19868], [105, 20148], [110, 20348], [112, 20488], [117, 20748], [120, 21028], [126, 21368], [129, 21568]]}, {"verse": 5, "start": 22121, "end": 30428, "text": "Then came Jesus forth, wearing the crown of thorns, and the purple robe. And Pilate says to them, Behold the man!", "words": [[0, 22121], [5, 22330], [10, 22650], [16, 23260], [23, 23870], [31, 24270], [35, 24530], [41, 24850], [44, 25030], [52, 25570], [56, 26030], [60, 26190], [67, 26430], [73, 27378], [77, 27727], [84, 28107], [89, 28287], [92, 28507], [98, 29105], [105, 29709], [109, 29969]]}, {"verse": 6, "start": 30708, "end": 42116, "text": "When the chief priests therefore and officers saw him, they cried out, saying, Crucify him, crucify him. Pilate says to them, Take him, and crucify him: for I find no fault in him.", "words": [[0, 30708], [5, 30850], [9, 30950], [15, 31170], [23, 31710], [33, 32250], [37, 32390], [46, 32850], [50, 33310], [55, 33810], [60, 33890], [66, 34170], [71, 34630], [79, 35318], [87, 35798], [92, 36158], [100, 36578], [105, 37426], [112, 37616], [117, 37976], [120, 38276], [126, 38890], [131, 39048], [136, 39268], [140, 39488], [148, 40108], [153, 40624], [157, 40730], [159, 40890], [164, 41030], [167, 41310], [173, 41630], [176, 41830]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 42396, "end": 48401, "text": "The Jews answered him, We have a law, and by our law he ought to die, because he made himself the Son of God.", "words": [[0, 42396], [4, 42490], [9, 42730], [18, 43150], [23, 43681], [26, 43801], [31, 43961], [33, 44081], [38, 44361], [42, 44821], [45, 45001], [49, 45141], [53, 45401], [56, 45601], [62, 45761], [65, 45901], [70, 46241], [78, 46701], [81, 46901], [86, 47081], [94, 47401], [98, 47601], [102, 47861], [105, 47981]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 48681, "end": 52353, "text": "¶ When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he was the more afraid;", "words": [[2, 48681], [7, 48826], [14, 49286], [24, 49606], [30, 49946], [35, 50126], [43, 51006], [46, 51186], [50, 51386], [54, 51546], [59, 51746]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 52703, "end": 59267, "text": "And went again into the judgment hall, and says to Jesus, From where are you? But Jesus gave him no answer.", "words": [[0, 52703], [4, 52847], [9, 53007], [15, 53347], [20, 53627], [24, 53767], [33, 54087], [39, 54527], [43, 54947], [48, 55167], [51, 55367], [58, 56243], [63, 56413], [69, 56633], [73, 56853], [78, 57416], [82, 57604], [88, 57944], [93, 58284], [97, 58484], [100, 58704]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 59617, "end": 66964, "text": "Then says Pilate to him, Do you not speak to me? do you not know that I have power to crucify you, and have power to release you?", "words": [[0, 59617], [5, 59864], [10, 60194], [17, 60524], [20, 60784], [25, 61291], [28, 61434], [32, 61574], [36, 61734], [42, 62054], [45, 62314], [49, 62871], [52, 63016], [56, 63136], [60, 63356], [65, 63596], [70, 63796], [72, 63936], [77, 64096], [83, 64396], [86, 64576], [94, 65116], [99, 65316], [103, 65536], [108, 65696], [114, 66056], [117, 66256], [125, 66496]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 67244, "end": 76067, "text": "Jesus answered, You could have no power at all against me, unless it were given you from above: therefore he that delivered me to you has the greater sin.", "words": [[0, 67244], [6, 67521], [16, 68492], [20, 68610], [26, 68750], [31, 68930], [34, 69130], [40, 69530], [43, 69730], [47, 70010], [55, 70390], [59, 70930], [66, 71130], [69, 71330], [74, 71450], [80, 71690], [84, 71910], [89, 72090], [96, 72851], [106, 73370], [109, 73530], [114, 73770], [124, 74070], [127, 74290], [130, 74470], [134, 74710], [138, 75030], [142, 75170], [150, 75430]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 76347, "end": 86910, "text": "And from then on Pilate sought to release him: but the Jews cried out, saying, If you let this man go, you are not Cæsar’s friend: whoever makes himself a king speaks against Cæsar.", "words": [[0, 76347], [4, 76494], [9, 76674], [14, 77014], [17, 77364], [24, 77714], [31, 78094], [34, 78314], [42, 78594], [47, 79199], [51, 79289], [55, 79429], [60, 79769], [66, 80169], [71, 80629], [79, 81407], [82, 81550], [86, 81650], [90, 81810], [95, 81990], [99, 82170], [103, 83030], [107, 83170], [111, 83250], [115, 83590], [123, 83930], [131, 84590], [139, 84787], [145, 85107], [153, 85427], [155, 85607], [160, 85827], [167, 86127], [175, 86542]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 87190, "end": 95939, "text": "¶ When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he brought Jesus forth, and sat down in the judgment seat in a place that is called the Pavement, but in the Hebrew, Gabbatha.", "words": [[2, 87190], [7, 87320], [14, 87860], [24, 88160], [30, 88520], [35, 88720], [43, 89460], [46, 89640], [54, 89880], [60, 90220], [67, 90660], [71, 90940], [75, 91180], [80, 91480], [83, 91640], [87, 91740], [96, 92020], [101, 92400], [104, 92600], [106, 92680], [112, 92900], [117, 93100], [120, 93200], [127, 93420], [131, 93580], [141, 94360], [145, 94580], [148, 94700], [152, 94820], [160, 95320]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 96289, "end": 103063, "text": "And it was the preparation of the passover, and about the sixth hour: and he says to the Jews, Behold your King!", "words": [[0, 96289], [4, 96429], [7, 96509], [11, 96649], [15, 96769], [27, 97329], [30, 97569], [34, 97689], [44, 98629], [48, 98829], [54, 99049], [58, 99269], [64, 99509], [70, 100319], [74, 100462], [77, 100602], [82, 100842], [85, 101062], [89, 101182], [95, 101989], [102, 102413], [107, 102573]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 103343, "end": 114275, "text": "But they cried out, Away with him, away with him, crucify him. Pilate says to them, Shall I crucify your King? The chief priests answered, We have no king but Cæsar.", "words": [[0, 103343], [4, 103451], [9, 103571], [15, 103851], [20, 104566], [25, 104893], [30, 105173], [35, 105613], [40, 105813], [45, 106133], [50, 106613], [58, 107133], [63, 107887], [70, 108077], [75, 108437], [78, 108737], [84, 109351], [90, 109507], [92, 109647], [100, 110127], [105, 110327], [111, 111011], [115, 111089], [121, 111329], [129, 111649], [139, 112617], [142, 112717], [147, 112937], [150, 113137], [155, 113417], [159, 113862]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 114555, "end": 120190, "text": "Then delivered he him therefore to them to be crucified. And they took Jesus, and led him away.", "words": [[0, 114555], [5, 114770], [15, 115190], [18, 115470], [22, 115730], [32, 116150], [35, 116430], [40, 116690], [43, 116910], [46, 117030], [57, 118082], [61, 118226], [66, 118326], [71, 118546], [78, 118986], [82, 119306], [86, 119506], [90, 119666]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 120540, "end": 127302, "text": "And he bearing his cross went forth into a place called the place of a skull, which is called in the Hebrew Golgotha:", "words": [[0, 120540], [4, 120687], [7, 120827], [15, 121147], [19, 121367], [25, 121747], [30, 122027], [36, 122367], [41, 122627], [43, 122827], [49, 123087], [56, 123387], [60, 123607], [66, 123867], [69, 124047], [71, 124167], [78, 125047], [84, 125227], [87, 125407], [94, 125727], [97, 125947], [101, 126047], [108, 126367]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 127652, "end": 132964, "text": "Where they crucified him, and two other with him, on either side one, and Jesus in the midst.", "words": [[0, 127652], [6, 127761], [11, 127901], [21, 128341], [26, 128761], [30, 129261], [34, 129481], [40, 129701], [45, 129961], [50, 130141], [53, 130401], [60, 130661], [65, 131141], [70, 131361], [74, 131701], [80, 132041], [83, 132361], [87, 132461]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 133314, "end": 140201, "text": "¶ And Pilate wrote a title, and put it on the cross. And the writing was, JESUS OF NAZARETH THE KING OF THE JEWS.", "words": [[2, 133314], [6, 133552], [13, 133822], [19, 134162], [21, 134262], [28, 134622], [32, 134902], [36, 135102], [39, 135222], [42, 135342], [46, 135442], [53, 136270], [57, 136410], [61, 136490], [69, 136810], [74, 137610], [80, 138070], [83, 138370], [92, 139050], [96, 139110], [101, 139330], [104, 139510], [108, 139610]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 140551, "end": 149250, "text": "This title then read many of the Jews: for the place where Jesus was crucified was near to the city: and it was written in Hebrew, and Greek, and Latin.", "words": [[0, 140551], [5, 140736], [11, 141116], [16, 141396], [21, 141656], [26, 141976], [29, 142156], [33, 142276], [39, 143066], [43, 143175], [47, 143295], [53, 143515], [59, 143775], [65, 144055], [69, 144375], [79, 144895], [83, 145275], [88, 145475], [91, 145615], [95, 145755], [101, 146463], [105, 146574], [108, 146654], [112, 146794], [120, 147054], [123, 147274], [131, 147634], [135, 148054], [142, 148414], [146, 148694]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 149600, "end": 157582, "text": "Then said the chief priests of the Jews to Pilate, Write not, The King of the Jews; but that he said, I am King of the Jews.", "words": [[0, 149600], [5, 149782], [10, 150062], [14, 150222], [20, 150462], [28, 150902], [31, 151162], [35, 151262], [40, 151542], [43, 151762], [51, 152773], [57, 152963], [62, 153373], [66, 153453], [71, 153653], [74, 153793], [78, 154118], [84, 154675], [88, 154781], [93, 155061], [96, 155141], [102, 155849], [104, 156176], [107, 156416], [112, 156676], [115, 156836], [119, 156956]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 157862, "end": 160761, "text": "Pilate answered, What I have written I have written.", "words": [[0, 158004], [7, 158154], [17, 159023], [22, 159165], [24, 159325], [29, 159445], [37, 159965], [39, 160105], [44, 160305]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 161041, "end": 173047, "text": "¶ Then the soldiers, when they had crucified Jesus, took his garments, and made four parts, to every soldier a part; and also his coat: now the coat was without seam, woven from the top throughout.", "words": [[2, 161041], [7, 161225], [11, 161365], [21, 161705], [26, 162005], [31, 162145], [35, 162245], [45, 162705], [52, 163225], [57, 163530], [61, 163710], [71, 164070], [75, 164670], [80, 164850], [85, 165130], [92, 165610], [95, 166010], [101, 166290], [109, 166687], [111, 167084], [117, 167642], [121, 167788], [126, 168048], [130, 168288], [136, 169019], [140, 169337], [144, 169637], [149, 169937], [153, 170177], [161, 170517], [167, 171377], [173, 171657], [178, 171957], [182, 172097], [186, 172377]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 173397, "end": 188608, "text": "They said therefore among themselves, Let us not rend it, but cast lots for it, whose it shall be: that the scripture might be fulfilled, which says, They parted my clothing among them, and for my vesture they did cast lots. These things therefore the soldiers did.", "words": [[0, 173397], [5, 173498], [10, 173858], [20, 174338], [26, 174538], [38, 175708], [42, 175884], [45, 176044], [49, 176224], [54, 176524], [58, 176684], [62, 176824], [67, 177184], [72, 177464], [76, 177744], [80, 178084], [86, 178184], [89, 178364], [95, 178544], [99, 179131], [104, 179259], [108, 179379], [118, 179699], [124, 180019], [127, 180199], [138, 180899], [144, 181099], [150, 181679], [155, 181939], [162, 182319], [165, 182479], [174, 182819], [180, 183119], [186, 183599], [190, 183919], [194, 184099], [197, 184279], [205, 184799], [210, 185179], [214, 185399], [219, 185719], [225, 186581], [231, 186730], [238, 187130], [248, 187590], [252, 187670], [261, 188050]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 188958, "end": 195881, "text": "¶ Now there stood by the cross of Jesus his mother, and his mother’s sister, Mary the wife of Cleophas, and Mary Magdalene.", "words": [[2, 188958], [6, 189134], [12, 189314], [18, 189514], [21, 189774], [25, 189914], [31, 190174], [34, 190354], [40, 190914], [44, 190974], [52, 191674], [56, 191794], [60, 191914], [69, 192334], [77, 192854], [82, 193054], [86, 193234], [91, 193454], [94, 194054], [104, 194654], [108, 194794], [113, 195054]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 196231, "end": 204137, "text": "When Jesus therefore saw his mother, and the disciple standing by, whom he loved, he says to his mother, Woman, behold your son!", "words": [[0, 196231], [5, 196356], [11, 196596], [21, 197056], [25, 197436], [29, 197616], [37, 197956], [41, 198356], [45, 198476], [54, 198876], [63, 199276], [67, 199996], [72, 200176], [75, 200356], [82, 201216], [85, 201336], [90, 201556], [93, 201736], [97, 201896], [105, 202557], [112, 203005], [119, 203325], [124, 203585]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 204417, "end": 214889, "text": "Then says he to the disciple, Behold your mother! And from that hour that disciple took her to his own home.", "words": [[0, 204417], [5, 204633], [10, 204953], [13, 205313], [16, 205533], [20, 205653], [30, 206549], [37, 206941], [42, 207121], [48, 209685], [50, 211723], [54, 211846], [59, 212026], [64, 212286], [69, 212556], [74, 212826], [83, 213326], [88, 213646], [92, 213806], [95, 213966], [99, 214146], [103, 214346]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 215239, "end": 222102, "text": "¶ After this, Jesus knowing that all things were now accomplished, that the scripture might be fulfilled, says, I thirst.", "words": [[2, 215239], [8, 215497], [14, 215837], [20, 216037], [28, 216497], [33, 216757], [37, 216937], [44, 217257], [49, 217497], [53, 217657], [67, 218597], [72, 218857], [76, 218977], [86, 219297], [92, 219597], [95, 219817], [106, 220397], [112, 221216], [114, 221462]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 222382, "end": 229852, "text": "Now there was set a vessel full of vinegar: and they filled a sponge with vinegar, and put it upon hyssop, and put it to his mouth.", "words": [[0, 222382], [4, 222946], [10, 223026], [14, 223166], [18, 223446], [20, 223566], [27, 223866], [32, 224226], [35, 224366], [44, 225173], [48, 225300], [53, 225440], [60, 225720], [62, 225880], [69, 226200], [74, 226480], [83, 226860], [87, 227420], [91, 227620], [94, 227720], [99, 228000], [107, 228560], [111, 228820], [115, 229000], [118, 229120], [121, 229260], [125, 229400]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 230202, "end": 237389, "text": "When Jesus therefore had received the vinegar, he said, It is finished: and he bowed his head, and gave up his spirit.", "words": [[0, 230202], [5, 230322], [11, 230802], [21, 231402], [25, 231482], [34, 231842], [38, 232082], [47, 232582], [50, 232662], [56, 233324], [59, 233453], [62, 233593], [72, 234530], [76, 234657], [79, 234797], [85, 235217], [89, 235317], [95, 235657], [99, 236137], [104, 236377], [107, 236577], [111, 236737]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 237739, "end": 251525, "text": "The Jews therefore, because it was the preparation, that the bodies should not remain upon the cross on the sabbath day, (for that sabbath day was a high day,) besought Pilate that their legs might be broken, and that they might be taken away.", "words": [[0, 237739], [4, 237847], [9, 238187], [20, 238887], [28, 239167], [31, 239347], [35, 239507], [39, 239647], [52, 240827], [57, 240947], [61, 241177], [68, 241407], [75, 241707], [79, 241987], [86, 242287], [91, 242607], [95, 242867], [101, 243207], [104, 243607], [108, 243727], [116, 244067], [121, 244863], [126, 244948], [131, 245108], [139, 245508], [143, 245848], [147, 246028], [149, 246168], [154, 246388], [160, 247208], [169, 247588], [176, 248108], [181, 248288], [187, 248488], [192, 248768], [198, 249028], [201, 249188], [209, 249568], [213, 250028], [218, 250168], [223, 250288], [229, 250488], [232, 250688], [238, 250968]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 251875, "end": 257662, "text": "Then came the soldiers, and broke the legs of the first, and of the other which was crucified with him.", "words": [[0, 251875], [5, 252064], [10, 252344], [14, 252544], [24, 253484], [28, 253604], [34, 253844], [38, 254084], [43, 254344], [46, 254524], [50, 254644], [57, 255284], [61, 255504], [64, 255644], [68, 255784], [74, 256004], [80, 256264], [84, 256424], [94, 256864], [99, 257264]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 258012, "end": 263120, "text": "But when they came to Jesus, and saw that he was dead already, they broke not his legs:", "words": [[0, 258012], [4, 258122], [9, 258262], [14, 258442], [19, 258702], [22, 258862], [29, 259302], [33, 259677], [37, 259937], [42, 260117], [45, 260237], [49, 260417], [54, 260637], [63, 261557], [68, 261737], [74, 262017], [78, 262297], [82, 262517]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 263470, "end": 269514, "text": "But one of the soldiers with a spear pierced his side, and forthwith came there out blood and water.", "words": [[0, 263470], [4, 263633], [8, 263873], [11, 263953], [15, 264113], [24, 264453], [29, 264733], [31, 264853], [37, 265193], [45, 265713], [49, 265833], [55, 266733], [59, 266973], [69, 267553], [74, 267873], [80, 268153], [84, 268393], [90, 268733], [94, 268933]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 269864, "end": 276844, "text": "And he that saw it bore witness, and his record is true: and he knows that he says true, that you might believe.", "words": [[0, 269864], [4, 270002], [7, 270142], [12, 270322], [16, 270662], [19, 270782], [24, 271022], [33, 271782], [37, 271982], [41, 272122], [48, 272462], [51, 272662], [57, 273434], [61, 273555], [64, 273675], [70, 273955], [75, 274215], [78, 274335], [83, 274535], [89, 275255], [94, 275635], [98, 275835], [104, 276075]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 277194, "end": 283065, "text": "For these things were done, that the scripture should be fulfilled, A bone of him shall not be broken.", "words": [[0, 277194], [4, 277294], [10, 277494], [17, 277834], [22, 278014], [28, 278754], [33, 278934], [37, 279074], [47, 279414], [54, 279754], [57, 279954], [68, 281034], [70, 281174], [75, 281454], [78, 281614], [82, 281774], [88, 282034], [92, 282254], [95, 282434]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 283415, "end": 287645, "text": "And again another scripture says, They shall look on him whom they pierced.", "words": [[0, 283415], [4, 283561], [10, 283881], [18, 284121], [28, 284501], [34, 285441], [39, 285641], [45, 285841], [50, 286061], [53, 286321], [57, 286501], [62, 286741], [67, 286921]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 287995, "end": 303090, "text": "¶ And after this Joseph of Arimathaea, being a disciple of Jesus, but secretly for fear of the Jews, besought Pilate that he might take away the body of Jesus: and Pilate gave him leave. He came therefore, and took the body of Jesus.", "words": [[2, 287995], [6, 288126], [12, 288406], [17, 288626], [24, 289046], [27, 289796], [39, 290546], [45, 290786], [47, 290946], [56, 291366], [59, 291626], [66, 292306], [70, 292406], [79, 292866], [83, 293186], [88, 293486], [91, 293686], [95, 293806], [101, 294726], [110, 295166], [117, 295786], [122, 295946], [125, 296106], [131, 296286], [136, 296546], [141, 296786], [145, 296986], [150,