ey Jesus therefore because of the Jews’ preparation day; for the tomb was near at hand.", "words": [[0, 328175], [6, 328265], [11, 328505], [16, 328805], [22, 329325], [32, 329825], [40, 330045], [43, 330285], [47, 330405], [53, 330825], [65, 331345], [70, 332154], [74, 332238], [78, 332378], [83, 332678], [87, 332858], [92, 333058], [95, 333218]]}]}